---
config:
  theme: redux
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Router
    participant Controller
    participant DB as MongoDB

    User->>Router: POST /api/v1/auth/login<br/>(email, password)
    Router->>Controller: login(req, res)
    Controller->>Controller: Validate email and password

    alt Missing or invalid input
        Controller-->>User: 400 Email and password required
    else Valid input
        Controller->>DB: Find user by email (include password hash)
        DB-->>Controller: User record or not found

        alt User not found
            Controller-->>User: 401 Invalid credentials
        else Account is locked
            Controller-->>User: 423 Account temporarily locked
        else Account can log in
            Controller->>Controller: Compare password with stored hash

            alt Incorrect password
                Controller->>DB: Update failed attempts&ﬂ°°59¶ß lock if threshold reached
                DB-->>Controller: Updated lock status
                Controller-->>User: 401 Invalid credentials
            else Correct password
                Controller->>DB: Clear failed attempts if account is not locked
                DB-->>Controller: Update result

                alt Email not verified
                    Controller-->>User: 403 Verify email before logging in
                else Login successful
                    Controller->>Controller: Generate JWT
                    Controller-->>User: 200 User details and token
                end
            end
        end
    end